{"id":"main_1_level_main_01-12_end","steps":[{"t":"cmd","c":"header","a":{"key":"title_test","is_skippable":true,"fit_mode":"BLACK_MASK"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"background","a":{"image":"bg_cher_3","width":1,"height":1,"fadetime":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playmusic","a":{"intro":"Sound_Beta_2/Music/beta2_180603/m_dia_escape_intro","key":"Sound_Beta_2/Music/beta2_180603/m_dia_escape_loop","volume":0.8,"crossfade":1.5,"delay":0.5}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_1504_cqbw"}},{"t":"line","name":"W","text":"Ahh... What a nostalgic feeling!"},{"t":"line","name":"W","text":"Amiya, was it?"},{"t":"line","name":"W","text":"——"},{"t":"line","name":"W","text":"Ah, ahaha! I see... So that's what's going on."},{"t":"line","name":"W","text":"I remember now, Amiya."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1#7"}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"...What?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_1504_cqbw"}},{"t":"line","name":"W","text":"I've already gotten what I came for. You can all go now. Shoo."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1#7"}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"You...!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_1504_cqbw","name2":"char_1002_nsabr_2","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Reunion Member","text":"W...?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_1504_cqbw","name2":"char_1002_nsabr_2","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"W","text":"... What, do you lot want to stay here and die? That's perfectly fine by me. You're all free to do as you please."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_1504_cqbw","name2":"char_1002_nsabr_2","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Reunion Member","text":"..."},{"t":"line","name":"Reunion Member","text":"We're falling back. Let them go. Talulah's orders."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1#7"}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"...?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_1504_cqbw"}},{"t":"line","name":"W","text":